<title>USA: Cyrk Inc acquires Champion Awards.</title>
<headline>Cyrk Inc acquires Champion Awards.</headline>
<dateline>GLOUCESTER, Mass 1997-06-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Cyrk Inc said Thursday that it has acquired privately-held Champion Awards &amp; Advertising Co, a Texas-based promotional products company.</p>
<p>Terms of the transaction were not disclosed.</p>
<p>The company said Champion's projected revenues for the 1997 fiscal year are about $4.5 million.</p>
<p>Cyrk is a diversified promotional products and services company.  Following the company's recent merger with Simon Marketing, its 1996 pro forma revenues $700 million.</p>
</text>
